/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Widget Blueprint: BP_MainMenu
Asset Path: /Game/Blueprints/UI/BP_MainMenu
Target Resolution: 1920 x 1080 (Canvas Panel Native)
C++ Base Class: UVELOCITYXMainMenuWidget (derives from UUserWidget)
Author: UI Designer (Nimbus)
================================================================================

1. WIDGET HIERARCHY TREE (1920x1080 Layout Canvas):
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[RootCanvas] (CanvasPanel)
  |-- [BackgroundShowcase] (Image)
  |     Anchors: Full Screen (Min: 0,0, Max: 1,1) | Offsets: (0,0,0,0)
  |     Brush: RenderTargetTexture / Dynamic 3D Car Showcase Camera Feed
  |     Z-Order: 0
  |
  |-- [ParticleEffectOverlay] (Image)
  |     Anchors: Full Screen (Min: 0,0, Max: 1,1) | Offsets: (0,0,0,0)
  |     Brush: Dynamic Particle / Embers / Speed Dust Material
  |     BlendMode: Additive | Opacity: 0.65
  |     Z-Order: 1
  |
  |-- [BackdropVignette] (Image)
  |     Anchors: Full Screen (Min: 0,0, Max: 1,1) | Offsets: (0,0,0,0)
  |     Color: LinearColor(0.01, 0.02, 0.04, 0.55) | Gradient Edge Vignette
  |     Z-Order: 2
  |
  |-- [TopHeaderBar] (HorizontalBox)
  |     Anchors: Top-Stretch (Min: 0,0, Max: 1,0) | Alignment: (0, 0)
  |     Offsets: Left: 80, Top: 40, Right: 80, Bottom: 80
  |     Z-Order: 10
  |     |-- [VersionTag] (TextBlock)
  |     |     Text: "VELOCITY X // BUILD 1.0.0 (RELEASE SPEC)"
  |     |     Font: Orbitron-Medium, Size 13, Color: (0.4, 0.55, 0.7, 0.8)
  |     |-- [Spacer_Header] (Spacer, Size: 1.0 Fill)
  |     |-- [ProfileStatsPanel] (HorizontalBox)
  |           |-- [Txt_CompletedRaces] (TextBlock)
  |           |     Text: "RACES: 0" | Font: Rajdhani-Bold, Size 15, Color: (0.0, 0.85, 1.0, 1.0)
  |           |-- [HeaderSep1] (TextBlock, Text: " | ")
  |           |-- [Txt_PlayTime] (TextBlock)
  |           |     Text: "TIME: 00h 00m" | Font: Rajdhani-Bold, Size 15, Color: (0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.8)
  |           |-- [HeaderSep2] (TextBlock, Text: " | ")
  |           |-- [Txt_BestOverall] (TextBlock)
  |                 Text: "RECORD: --:--.---" | Font: Rajdhani-Bold, Size 15, Color: (1.0, 0.8, 0.1, 1.0)
  |
  |-- [TitleContainer] (VerticalBox)
  |     Anchors: Left-Top (Min: 0,0, Max: 0,0) | Alignment: (0, 0)
  |     Position: X: 120, Y: 180 | Size: X: 700, Y: 220
  |     Z-Order: 10
  |     |-- [LogoImage] (Image)
  |     |     Size: 480 x 110 | Brush: Material'/Game/Materials/UI/M_UI_LogoShimmer'
  |     |-- [TitleText] (TextBlock)
  |     |     Text: "VELOCITY X"
  |     |     Font: Syncopate-Bold / Italic, Size 72, Letter-Spacing: 120
  |     |     Color: LinearColor(1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0)
  |     |     ShadowOffset: (3, 3), ShadowColor: (1.0, 0.05, 0.15, 0.8)
  |     |-- [SubtitleText] (TextBlock)
  |           Text: "HIGHWAY PURSUIT & HYPERCAR DYNAMICS"
  |           Font: Rajdhani-SemiBold, Size 18, Letter-Spacing: 250
  |           Color: LinearColor(0.0, 0.85, 1.0, 0.9)
  |
  |-- [MenuButtonsBox] (VerticalBox)
  |     Anchors: Left-Center (Min: 0,0.5, Max: 0,0.5) | Alignment: (0, 0.5)
  |     Position: X: 120, Y: 140 | Size: X: 420, Y: 380
  |     Z-Order: 10
  |     |-- [PlayButton] (Button) -> Bound to UVELOCITYXMainMenuWidget::PlayButton
  |     |     Size: 400 x 64 | Margin: Bottom 16
  |     |     Style: Normal (SlateBrush Navy/Black 0.8 alpha, Cyan Border 2px)
  |     |            Hovered (SlateBrush Velocity Crimson, Glow Border 3px)
  |     |            Pressed (SlateBrush Pure White, Text Black)
  |     |     Child: [Txt_Play] (TextBlock, Text: "01 // START RACE", Font: Rajdhani-Bold, Size 24)
  |     |
  |     |-- [CarSelectButton] (Button)
  |     |     Size: 400 x 64 | Margin: Bottom 16
  |     |     Child: [Txt_CarSelect] (TextBlock, Text: "02 // SELECT VEHICLE", Font: Rajdhani-Bold, Size 24)
  |     |
  |     |-- [SettingsButton] (Button) -> Bound to UVELOCITYXMainMenuWidget::SettingsButton
  |     |     Size: 400 x 64 | Margin: Bottom 16
  |     |     Child: [Txt_Settings] (TextBlock, Text: "03 // SETTINGS", Font: Rajdhani-Bold, Size 24)
  |     |
  |     |-- [QuitButton] (Button) -> Bound to UVELOCITYXMainMenuWidget::QuitButton
  |           Size: 400 x 64 | Margin: Bottom 16
  |           Child: [Txt_Exit] (TextBlock, Text: "04 // EXIT GAME", Font: Rajdhani-Bold, Size 24)
  |
  |-- [FooterControlsHint] (HorizontalBox)
  |     Anchors: Bottom-Left (Min: 0,1, Max: 0,1) | Alignment: (0, 1)
  |     Position: X: 120, Y: -40 | Size: X: 800, Y: 40
  |     Z-Order: 10
  |     |-- [Hint_Select] (TextBlock, Text: "[ENTER / LMB] SELECT    [ESC] BACK    [W/S] NAVIGATE")
  |           Font: Rajdhani-Medium, Size 14, Color: (0.5, 0.6, 0.7, 0.6)
  |
  |-- [ScreenFadeOverlay] (Border)
        Anchors: Full Screen (Min: 0,0, Max: 1,1) | Offsets: (0,0,0,0)
        Background Color: LinearColor(0,0,0,1)
        Visibility: HitTestInvisible
        Z-Order: 100

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. ANIMATION TIMELINE REGISTRY:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A. [Anim_FadeIn] (Duration: 0.6s):
   - Track: ScreenFadeOverlay.RenderOpacity (Key 0.0s: 1.0 -> Key 0.6s: 0.0)
   - Track: TitleContainer.RenderTranslation (Key 0.0s: (-60, 0) -> Key 0.6s: (0, 0), Cubic EaseOut)
   - Track: MenuButtonsBox.RenderOpacity (Key 0.0s: 0.0 -> Key 0.5s: 1.0)

B. [Anim_FadeOut] (Duration: 0.4s):
   - Track: ScreenFadeOverlay.RenderOpacity (Key 0.0s: 0.0 -> Key 0.4s: 1.0)
   - Track: MenuButtonsBox.RenderTranslation (Key 0.0s: (0, 0) -> Key 0.4s: (-40, 0))

C. [Anim_LogoPulse] (Duration: 2.0s, Infinite Loop):
   - Track: LogoImage.RenderScale (Key 0.0s: (1.0, 1.0) -> Key 1.0s: (1.03, 1.03) -> Key 2.0s: (1.0, 1.0))
   - Track: SubtitleText.RenderOpacity (Key 0.0s: 0.75 -> Key 1.0s: 1.0 -> Key 2.0s: 0.75)

D. [Anim_ButtonHover] (Duration: 0.15s per button):
   - Track: TargetButton.RenderTranslation (Key 0.0s: (0, 0) -> Key 0.15s: (16.0, 0.0))
   - Track: TextBlock.ColorAndOpacity (Key 0.0s: Light Gray -> Key 0.15s: Velocity Crimson)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. SOUND BINDINGS:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   - SFX_Hover: SoundCue'/Game/Audio/UI/SC_UI_Hover'
   - SFX_Click: SoundCue'/Game/Audio/UI/SC_UI_Click'
   - SFX_Transition: SoundCue'/Game/Audio/UI/SC_UI_Transition'

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. C++ DELEGATES & BLUEPRINT EVENT GRAPH:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

C++ Base Class Bindings:
   - OnPlayButtonClickedDelegate (Multicast Delegate on UVELOCITYXMainMenuWidget)
   - OnSettingsButtonClickedDelegate (Multicast Delegate on UVELOCITYXMainMenuWidget)
   - OnQuitButtonClickedDelegate (Multicast Delegate on UVELOCITYXMainMenuWidget)
   - OnCreditsButtonClickedDelegate (Multicast Delegate on UVELOCITYXMainMenuWidget)

GameMode Bindings:
   - In AVELOCITYXGameMode:
     Delegates: OnGameStateChanged (EGameState), OnCarSelected (ECarType)
     Functions: SetGameState(NewState), SelectCar(CarType), GetSelectedCarType()

Event NativeConstruct:
   1. Super::NativeConstruct() (Auto-binds PlayButton, SettingsButton, QuitButton, CreditsButton)
   2. Bind to OnPlayButtonClickedDelegate -> HandlePlayClicked
   3. Bind to OnSettingsButtonClickedDelegate -> HandleSettingsClicked
   4. Bind to OnQuitButtonClickedDelegate -> HandleQuitClicked
   5. Bind to GameMode::OnGameStateChanged delegate
   6. Play Animation (Anim_FadeIn)
   7. Play Animation (Anim_LogoPulse, NumLoops=0)
   8. Ingest GameInstance Stats:
      - Get GameInstance -> Cast to UVELOCITYXGameInstance
      - If Valid:
          * CompletedRaces -> Set Text (Txt_CompletedRaces)
          * TotalPlayTime -> Format "HHh MMm" -> Set Text (Txt_PlayTime)
          * BestLapTimes[0] -> Format lap -> Set Text (Txt_BestOverall)

HandlePlayClicked:
   1. Play Sound 2D (SFX_Click)
   2. Play Sound 2D (SFX_Transition)
   3. Play Animation (Anim_FadeOut)
   4. Set Timer by Event (Delay = 0.4s):
      - Get GameMode -> Cast to AVELOCITYXGameMode
      - Call SetGameState(EGameState::Racing)
      - Open Level "HighwayCorridor_Map"

On Clicked (CarSelectButton):
   1. Play Sound 2D (SFX_Click)
   2. Play Animation (Anim_FadeOut)
   3. Set Timer by Event (Delay = 0.35s):
      - Get GameMode -> Cast to AVELOCITYXGameMode
      - Call SetGameState(EGameState::CarSelect)
      - Create Widget (BP_CarSelection) -> Add to Viewport
      - Remove from Parent (Self)

HandleSettingsClicked:
   1. Play Sound 2D (SFX_Click)
   2. Create Widget (BP_Settings) -> Add to Viewport (Z-Order = 20)

HandleQuitClicked:
   1. Play Sound 2D (SFX_Click)
   2. Play Animation (Anim_FadeOut)
   3. Set Timer by Event (Delay = 0.35s):
      - Quit Game (GetPlayerController(0), QuitPreference=Quit)
================================================================================
*/
